  "assumptions": [
   "Power: about 1800 respondents per arm to detect 0.04 at 80% power (source S3 differences 0.055-0.056, SE 0.017); the cross-format interaction needs about double the cell size, so total N about 3600 or more.",
   "Platform: YouGov-type US panel; compensation per panel standard.",
   "Item order randomized; headline sets balanced across topics and counterbalanced across formats; standard errors clustered by respondent.",
   "Embedded stimulus fields shown for the two formats are fixed sets in the order given; headline-to-slot assignment is randomized by the survey platform."
  ],
